        By accessing, browsing, or using this website, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms of Use and to comply with all applicable laws and regulations. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use this website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">2. Description of Services</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">
        Solorithm provides professional IT operations, consulting, and managed services, including Network Operations (NetOps), Systems Operations (SysOps), and Security Operations (SecOps). Any new features or services added to the website or our service catalog shall also be subject to these Terms of Use.
